"{\n \"title\": \"How it works — PadhaiShuru | PadhaiShuru\",\n \"headings\": [\n  \"H2: The loop that builds skills.\",\n  \"H3: Learn\",\n  \"H3: Do\",\n  \"H3: Get feedback\",\n  \"H3: Adapt\",\n  \"H3: Repeat\",\n  \"H3: Improve\",\n  \"H2: A great teacher doesn't just give you answers.\",\n  \"H2: AI that adapts to your practice.\",\n  \"H3: You're struggling?\",\n  \"H3: Making the same mistake?\",\n  \"H3: Already mastering it?\",\n  \"H3: Losing progress?\",\n  \"H2: See how it works.\",\n  \"H2: Turn progress into a challenge.\",\n  \"H3: 30-Day Guitar Foundation\"\n ],\n \"paragraphs\": [\n  \"Every learning experience follows the same loop — designed around how people actually learn, practice, and remember.\",\n  \"Start with a structured lesson designed to make the next step clear without overwhelming you. Information is delivered in the right amount, at the right pace.\",\n  \"Don't just finish the lesson. Apply what you learned through real practice. Active engagement is where skills actually develop.\",\n  \"Depending on the skill, AI can analyze your performance, identify mistakes, and help you understand exactly what needs to change.\",\n  \"If you're struggling, the experience changes. You may get a simpler explanation, a different example, or targeted practice on what's hard.\",\n  \"Important skills return through spaced practice instead of being forgotten after one lesson. Repetition is structured, not random.\",\n  \"Track progress over time and gradually take on more difficult challenges. Growth is visible, measurable, and motivating.\",\n  \"They notice where you're stuck. They explain things another way. They simplify what's difficult. They correct mistakes. They know when you're ready for the next level.\",\n  \"PadhaiShuru uses AI to bring more of that adaptive learning experience into online skill development. Not to replace instructors — but to make learning more responsive, available, and personalized.\",\n  \"AI isn't just a chatbot beside a course. It's an active part of the learning loop — responding to how you practice, where you struggle, and when you're ready for more.\",\n  \"The AI detects where you're stuck and adjusts — slower explanations, different examples, or targeted practice on that specific area.\",\n  \"The AI notices patterns in your practice and focuses on the weakness that's holding you back.\",\n  \"Move forward instead of repeating what you already know. The AI recognizes your progress and adjusts accordingly.\",\n  \"Important skills return at the right time. Spaced review ensures what you learn stays with you.\",\n  \"An example of learning guitar — learn, practice, get feedback, and improve.\",\n  \"Watch a learner go through the full loop — learn, struggle, understand, practice, and improve.\",\n  \"Learning doesn't have to be lonely. Challenges, streaks, and friendly competition make practice more engaging — without feeling like a game.\",\n  \"Build consistent practice habits and master core skills.\",\n  \"Progress is measured by consistency, improvement, and completion — not just who's already the strongest. The experience rewards meaningful practice over raw ability.\"\n ],\n \"listItems\": []\n}"